                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "8a91bab5-ab46-4022-bd20-21cb89c3107d",
                        "entry_id": "b79c7794-64e8-32d2-bb11-9a6c40ef0610",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "chrematists"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "52995197-6248-3893-99a4-84a93a21d9a9",
                        "entry_id": "b79c7794-64e8-32d2-bb11-9a6c40ef0610",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who studies or guides the wealth of the state; a political economist."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad22fe4d-d35a-436c-9729-ac4107c0ba5f",
                                "sense_id": "52995197-6248-3893-99a4-84a93a21d9a9",
                                "text": "An augmentation of production is generally considered as an addition to national wealth ; and it is on this ground that all nations, under the guidance of the Chrematists, are making such strenuous efforts to increase their agricultural and manufactured produce."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3da0ab5c-6e88-498f-87ff-5a5e12f36794",
                                "sense_id": "52995197-6248-3893-99a4-84a93a21d9a9",
                                "text": "They complained to Apollonius but Apollonius was not able to appear personally and sent a judge, the chrematist Peton, before whose court the peasants had to appear."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2bfba5c4-1ed9-40e0-bd31-3e16a126e4e9",
                                "sense_id": "52995197-6248-3893-99a4-84a93a21d9a9",
                                "text": "In the letter he gives Leon good news about the condemnation of their opponents by the chrematists, and states that the king will hear the case."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8abdc91b-d56e-46a3-a475-4bbd65831980",
                                "sense_id": "52995197-6248-3893-99a4-84a93a21d9a9",
                                "text": "The great philosopher Thales of Miletus was a part-time chrematist. According to Aristotle, Thales was reproached with his personal poverty as clear evidence that his philosophy was of no use: 'Thales, if you're so smart, how come you ain't rich?\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5738bac2-8ba2-3d28-a731-f7eab1d91d4b",
                        "entry_id": "b79c7794-64e8-32d2-bb11-9a6c40ef0610",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who seeks to acquire wealth; a money-grubber."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7af79c56-16ee-4025-9302-28c579820bc2",
                                "sense_id": "5738bac2-8ba2-3d28-a731-f7eab1d91d4b",
                                "text": "In this scene he seems to generate money out of itself, like Aristotle's exploitative usurer or chrematist."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "263096d1-8260-49d2-a44c-9b9af4fa37a9",
                                "sense_id": "5738bac2-8ba2-3d28-a731-f7eab1d91d4b",
                                "text": "Unlimited accumulation is the goal of the chrematist and is evidence for Aristotle of the unnaturalness of the activity."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d2b3a577-7436-4127-95cd-0a9c417bccec",
                                "sense_id": "5738bac2-8ba2-3d28-a731-f7eab1d91d4b",
                                "text": "The chrematist is a harsh employer and partner, for he will use any means to maximise his targets."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
